30,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I found that the staffing rolls show most trained phenotyping technicians left for industry over two years, while applicants for modelling and code posts now arrive in numbers.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found that the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers show the vehicle-hire and per-diem lines frozen for three seasons while shipping charges climbed, though the ministry extended its bench-fee subsidy for glasshouse space.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"I found that the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities show the animal facility cleared its accreditation renewal in spring and gained resident veterinary cover, while glasshouse blocks are booked solid through two more growing cycles.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,I found that the portfolio review found awards built on live breeding colonies overran schedule twice as often as those whose main risk sat in computation rather than biology.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"I found that the closeout files show catalogue-style awards here still drawing outside users a decade on, while several mechanism-focused ones ended with their central question unresolved.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Servas,,"I also found that the minutes on secondments and crew strength note both senior modelling analysts are seconded abroad until next autumn, while the glasshouse crew came through the restructuring at full strength.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Midori,,"I also found that the national computing agreement and facility day rates show the renewed national computing agreement covers simulation and modelling hours at no charge, while animal-unit day rates rose sharply after last year's vivarium rebuild.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Kenji,,I also found that the incident logs record the shared spectroscopy suite standing idle eleven weeks last year after its service contract lapsed; one engineer now covers three institutes.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I also found that the station records show three of the five partner field sites losing a whole season to flooding or fire, while indoor holding rooms ran through uninterrupted.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"I also found that the staffing rolls show most trained phenotyping technicians left for industry over two years, while applicants for modelling and code posts now arrive in numbers.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
